{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1327.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"13a1ab1990a95d42dad314f0dc487342470dcf75f9f3a977b6483d8a7f0899d4","ja":"コーヒーに包まれて","zh":"沉浸在咖啡中","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1327.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"fe9146024aa7f1f8ced43ab72dc331ad1ae033bdb8b7ccd072551a898a6cf8d0","ja":"わたしは新作パフェとカフェオレのセットに\nしようかな～♪　星梨花ちゃんはどれにする？","zh":"我选新品芭菲配欧蕾咖啡的套餐\n好了～♪　星梨花选哪样？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1327.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"5038b05cfbdc65b9fb82f08f8c20ea368ab724f8f05840898d2278fc6c02d674","ja":"え～っと……わたしは、いちごパフェと\nコーヒーのセットをお願いします！","zh":"嗯……我要草莓芭菲和\n咖啡的套餐，拜托了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1327.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"a7c0eb0857e2c064914e015dd318b6fe31761ba9dab94213630272fac7accc7e","ja":"このお店、コーヒーのいい香りがしますね。\nあっ、お仕事をしてる人がいますよ。","zh":"这家店有股好闻的咖啡香呢。\n啊，有人正在工作呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1327.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"885e6a89ecb7af8c344fd991425e5937185251063cdcb2ad9582e91778b9533d","ja":"ほんとだ。カフェでお仕事なんて、\nなんだかちょっとかっこいいかも。","zh":"真的耶。在咖啡厅工作什么的，\n总觉得有点帅气呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1327.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"c3beeb9f08c8786cc72877a9f809ed28e9f36a2e49b805db1a1386a425ebee86","ja":"できる大人の人って感じですね。\n●●●●プロデューサーさんみたいです。","zh":"很有干练成熟大人的感觉呢。\n就像●●●●制作人一样。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1327.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"b231706ca51eb65f86955698f4ec8fb98f25863abd818aa3ba0389f334a3519b","ja":"それに、コーヒーを飲んでる人を見てると、\nなんだか美味しそうに見えてきました♪","zh":"而且，看着别人喝咖啡，\n总觉得好像很好喝的样子♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1327.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"268606c2f288e146a7146edd90009c6130fa63bddadcba4e2d97f23400d5365c","ja":"美味しそうに飲む演技の参考にもなるかもね！","zh":"说不定还能作为喝得很美味的表演参考呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1327.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"cb47477f145a2e68a2ec2d896263a9f4c24d9ee96be993eab60ae137220537e5","ja":"……あっ、コーヒーとパフェが来たよ♪\n星梨花ちゃん、ミルクと砂糖はどれくらい入れる？","zh":"……啊，咖啡和芭菲送来了哦♪\n星梨花，牛奶和糖要加多少？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1327.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"4363456fee794180ab31551d5a3b13b559978dd3121ea3afdcff0c3fa2dd566e","ja":"いえ……わたし、\n今日はブラックで飲もうと思います！","zh":"不用了……我今天\n打算喝黑咖啡！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1327.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"02eb42c90368db912ad7b5e6ae7c6cf697400399cab7d904e81e5ff86c05851a","ja":"えっ、大丈夫！？","zh":"咦，没事吧！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1327.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"174d5881efddfc201253e2aa001ae11e92d4be41064300fab59478cc985c2113","ja":"はい、きっと演技をするのに\n必要だって思うから……！","zh":"是的，因为我坚信这对演戏\n肯定很有必要……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1327.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"a06cd9e4ecb7ece5fa1b4742e342e3733ea8c41de0fcd63f2ccf0adc3b2674fb","ja":"わかった！　それじゃあ頑張って！","zh":"我知道了！那你要加油哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1327.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"809c80082d49d537fea8fae5839e1f1adc457e33a1ad34fca7c2d9a280966aca","ja":"はい！　それじゃあ……いただきます！","zh":"好！那么……我开动了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
